[35m|[m * [1;33m|[m [33m16c122f[m Update dependencies and enhance user session management. Upgrade @stripe/stripe-js to version 8.5.3. Refactor App component to improve authentication state handling and add resetAuthState function. Enhance RentalProviderRegistration with improved CVR validation and company search functionality. Introduce conditional rendering for rental provider registration in RenterPage based on user role.
