[35m|[m * [1;33m|[m [33m4767833[m Add user role management to AdminPage and RenterPage. Introduce userRole state to fetch and display the current user's role, enhancing the user interface with role badges. Update LandingPage button styles for improved visibility.
[35m|[m * [1;33m|[m [33mad999fc[m Enhance BookingRequest component with new date formatting functions and improved handling of booking times. Update PaymentForm to include authToken for secure booking confirmation. Refactor MachineSearch and MyBookings components to display owner names instead of IDs, and improve user feedback on machine details. Introduce dashboard statistics for rental providers in ProviderPage, including total machines, current bookings, and revenue metrics.
[35m|[m * [1;33m|[m [33m2cb7533[m Add instant booking feature across components. Update App to manage user roles and navigation based on role. Enhance AddMachine, BookingRequest, and ProviderPage to support instant booking functionality, including UI updates for user feedback.
